---
model: gemini-3.8-flash
input:
  schema:
    audioMime: string, the audio MIME type
    audioData: string, base64-encoded audio, one recording
output:
  format: json
  schema:
    transcript: string, the words spoken, verbatim
    language: string, en or sw or other
    unclear: boolean, true when the audio is unintelligible
---
Transcribe the audio verbatim. Do not summarise, translate or add anything. Keep the speaker's language. Set language to en, sw or other. Set unclear to true when the audio is unintelligible, and leave transcript empty in that case.

{{media type="audioMime" data="audioData"}}
